  "solution": "Logic : [(1st number ÷ 2) + 1] × 1st number = 2nd number\n\nSo, \n\n__\n \n• 16 ∶ 144\n\n[(**16 ÷ 2**__) + 1] × 16 = 144\n\n[__**8 + 1**__] × 16 = 144\n\n__**9 × 16**__ = 144\n\n144 = 144 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n__\n \n• 14 ∶ 112\n\n[**(14 ÷ 2)**__ + 1] × 14 = 112\n\n[__**7 + 1**__] × 14 = 112\n\n__**8 × 14**__ = 112\n\n112 = 112 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n__\n \n• 22 ∶ ?\n\n[**(22 ÷ 2)**__ + 1] × 22 = ?\n\n[__**11 + 1**__] × 22 = ?\n\n__**12 × 22**__ = ?\n\n264 = ?\n\nHence, \"264\" is the correct answer.\n\n3e:T",
